<h1>2025年淮安生物工程高等职业学校公开招聘高层次人才（第二批）拟聘用人员公示</h1>
<h3></h3>
<h2>发布时间：2026-06-24 【<a onclick="window.close();">关闭窗口</a>】</h2>
<p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">根据《2025年淮安生物工程高等职业学校公开招聘高层次人才公告（第二批）》规定，经过公开报名、考核、体检、考察等程序，确定王飞雪同志为本次公开招聘拟聘用人员，现予以公示。如有不同意见，请于2026年7月2日下午5:00前（上午：9:00-11:30，下午：2:00-5:00），以书面、电话或当面向有关部门反映。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">监督电话：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">淮安生物工程高等职业学校：0517-85995978；</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">淮安市人力资源和社会保障局：0517-83671213</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">附件：</span><a id="ueditorFile_2c94938f9ef0711a019ef88bf6d325bf" href="/upload/2026-06/3ee45dde-bd54-4e73-a913-36ab5e95c2a1.xls" title="2025年淮安生物工程高等职业学校公开招聘高层次人才（第二批）拟聘用人员名单.xls" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">2025年淮安生物工程高等职业学校公开招聘高层次人才（第二批）拟聘用人员名单</span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 淮安生物工程高等职业学校</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2026年6月24日</span></p><p><br/></p>
